    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of a stick man named Stickman who, reluctantly compelled by the winds of destiny, must save the land from an evil stick man named Evil Stickman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickman's Bad Luck is a short, story-rich 2D Platformer. As a Metroidvania game, you will traverse new places as you unlock pathways with the items you collect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally published many years ago, this remastered version of Stickman's Bad Luck features improved music, updated graphics, bug fixes, and some extra surprises along the way.</p>",
